{"ts":"2026-07-24T12:02:38.401Z","author":"claude-code-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Current-main evidence: benchmark:scale:check ran the checked-in 10k fixture and preserved the fixed budget manifest. CLI create best/min was 363 ms against 310 ms; create peak RSS was 139,964,416 bytes against 115,184,640; claim peak RSS was 138,199,040 against 118,031,360. Read-path p95 remained below one second and all default outputs stayed below 5k estimated tokens. The implementation must diagnose allocation/startup causes and restore the existing budgets without raising thresholds, excluding paths, weakening iterations, or removing behavior. SDK parity and tiny-project responsiveness are guardrails."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-hcrmye"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"10k scale gate regression: CLI create latency and create/claim peak RSS exceed fixed budgets"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The deterministic 10k scale gate fails on current main under Node 26 because CLI create exceeds its latency ceiling and CLI create/claim exceed peak-memory ceilings; product p95 and token budgets still pass."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:cli","area:performance","area:sdk","regression","scale"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T12:02:38.401Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T12:02:38.401Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"claude-code-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The unmodified 10k scale gate passes at least three consecutive runs on the supported Node baseline; cli.create best/min is at or below 310 ms; cli.create peak RSS is at or below 115184640 bytes and cli.claim peak RSS is at or below 118031360 bytes; no budget increase, exclusion, iteration reduction, or feature loss; SDK and CLI correctness/token checks remain green; before/after phase and allocation evidence identifies the cause."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-9rxu"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"pnpm benchmark:scale:check passes the committed latency, RSS, correctness, and token budgets without budget relaxation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Current main fails cli.create latency plus cli.create and cli.claim peak RSS ceilings while all other reported product budgets pass."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"performance"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/regression","value":true},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-24T12:02:38.401Z","author":"claude-code-agent","text":"Duplicate-check evidence: all-status search over scale, create, claim, RSS, memory, and benchmark terms found the closed harness pm-mi2x and the living scale epic pm-9rxu, but no open item owning this current fixed-budget regression. Filed as a focused child of pm-9rxu."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"2b1fc537ed12784dbcad62634b8cd01c43e7e59fd28a051716a7886b3a81ebcf","message":""}
